# good: D10 sits the other way round (first post is C3), so the same loop lights it yellow.
kits scb20
grid 7x5 grid-mini
step 1: grid
step 2: B3B at A1 dir=right level=1
step 3: S1 at C1 dir=down level=1
step 4: D10 at C3 dir=down level=1
step 5: wire3 at A1 dir=down level=2
step 6: wire3 at D1 dir=right level=2
step 7: wire3 at C3 dir=up level=2
expect S1=on: D10 yellow
expect S1=off: D10 off
